---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Disclaimer | DigiHawke Media"
  description="Legal Disclaimer for DigiHawke Media. Understand the nature of marketing results, third-party links, and limitations of our advisory services."
>
  <section class="pt-32 pb-24 bg-gradient-to-b from-surface-container-lowest to-background relative select-none">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top,_var(--color-surface-container-low),_transparent_70%)] pointer-events-none"></div>
    <div class="max-w-[800px] mx-auto px-6 relative z-10 text-left">
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-display font-extrabold text-white mb-4 text-glow-indigo">
        Disclaimer
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant font-mono">
        Last Updated: July 15, 2026
      </p>
      
      <!-- Content Blocks -->
      <div class="mt-12 text-sm text-on-surface-variant font-sans leading-relaxed flex flex-col gap-8">

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-display font-bold text-white mb-3">1. General Notice</h2>
          <p>
            The information provided on <a href="https://digihawke.com" class="text-secondary hover:underline">digihawke.com</a> is published in good faith and for general informational purposes only. DigiHawke Media makes no representations or warranties of any kind, express or implied, regarding the accuracy, completeness, or reliability of any content or services described herein.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-display font-bold text-white mb-3">2. No Financial or Legal Advice</h2>
          <p>
            Nothing on this website constitutes financial, legal, or investment advice. All marketing frameworks, case studies, budget projections, and strategy content are provided for illustrative and educational purposes. You should always seek qualified professional counsel before implementing any significant marketing or business investment decisions.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-display font-bold text-white mb-3">3. Marketing Results & Case Studies</h2>
          <p class="mb-3">
            Performance metrics, case study figures, and growth projections displayed on this website (such as "+240% Search Revenue" or "-42% CPA Reduction") represent historical outcomes for specific clients in specific competitive conditions. These results:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 flex flex-col gap-2">
            <li>Are <strong>not a guarantee</strong> of identical or similar outcomes for your business.</li>
            <li>May vary significantly based on industry vertical, competition, ad budget, and product-market fit.</li>
            <li>Should be evaluated independently against current market benchmarks before forming any expectations.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-3">
            The interactive Growth Channel Estimator on our Services page is a simulation tool only. Output figures are projections based on generalized marketing multipliers and do not constitute binding performance commitments.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-display font-bold text-white mb-3">4. Third-Party Links</h2>
          <p>
            Our website may contain links to external websites operated by third parties including Google, Meta (Facebook), LinkedIn, and similar platforms. These links are provided for your convenience only. We have no control over the content, privacy practices, or accuracy of third-party websites. The inclusion of any link does not necessarily imply endorsement of those views or services.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-display font-bold text-white mb-3">5. Service Availability</h2>
          <p>
            DigiHawke Media does not warrant that the website or any digital marketing services will be available at all times, error-free, or free of viruses. We reserve the right to modify, suspend, or terminate access to any part of the site without prior notice or liability.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-display font-bold text-white mb-3">6. Changes to This Disclaimer</h2>
          <p>
            We reserve the right to update or revise this Disclaimer at any time without prior notice. Continued use of the site after such revisions constitutes your acknowledgment and acceptance of the updated terms.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="p-6 rounded-[4px] bg-surface-container border border-outline-variant/60">
          <h2 class="text-base font-display font-bold text-white mb-3 uppercase tracking-wider">7. Contact & Registered Office</h2>
          <p class="mb-4">
            If you have any concerns regarding the content or scope of this Disclaimer, please contact us directly:
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 font-mono text-xs">
            <div><strong class="text-white">Agency:</strong> DigiHawke Media</div>
            <div><strong class="text-white">Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:help@digihawke.com" class="text-secondary hover:underline">help@digihawke.com</a></div>
            <div><strong class="text-white">Office:</strong> Barhaj, Dist - Deoria , Gorakhpur. U.P - 274601, India</div>
            <div><strong class="text-white">Website:</strong> <a href="https://digihawke.com" class="text-secondary hover:underline">digihawke.com</a></div>
          </div>
        </section>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
